{"pull": {"id": "number:21700", "number": 21700, "title": "KAFKA-20268: Initialize group epochs to 1 for assignment offload", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-03-10T14:24:13Z", "closed_at": "2026-03-11T08:42:52Z", "merged_at": "2026-03-11T08:42:52Z", "user": {"login": "squah-confluent", "id": 163298686, "node_id": "U_kgDOCbu9fg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163298686?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent", "html_url": "https://github.com/squah-confluent", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Once assignment offload is implemented, newly created groups may not\nhave their first assignment at epoch 1 available yet. We cannot give the\nmember an epoch of 0, since it is reserved for new members joining a\ngroup. The new member's epoch must be greater than 0 and less than the\ngroup epoch.\n\nTo resolve this, we initialize groups at epoch 1 with target assignment\nepoch 1. Epoch 1 contains an empty assignment and the first computed\nassignment will have epoch 2. Members joining a new group will reconcile\ntowards epoch 1 while waiting for epoch 2's assignment.\n\nStreams groups already start group epochs at 2. We update streams groups\nto use the same approach as consumer and share groups.\n\nReviewers: Lucas Brutschy <lbrutschy@confluent.io>, David Jacot\n <djacot@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 8846059803, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAACD0QpGw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/group-coordinator", "name": "group-coordinator", "color": "9AFD22", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21700"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_squah-confluent_is_pr.json"}